{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51376","headline":"苏小小墓 · 徐凝","name":"苏小小墓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古木寒鸦噪夕阳，六朝遗恨草茫茫。\n水如香篆船如叶，咫尺西陵不见郎。\n（《舆地纪胜三《嘉兴府·古迹》（熊飞云《宋诗纪事》卷二十二据《嘉兴府志补》收此诗爲沈括作。\n今按徐凝有《嘉兴寒食》诗咏及苏小小墓，此诗疑因脱冒而误归其名下。\n沈括《长兴集》存本诗皆缺失，尚难定谳，姑仍存。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}